The [[Stone Shoes]] are neutral [[Shoes]] normally obtained by combining the [[Leather Boots]] with a [[Stone Skin Potion]]. It has an effect similar to the [[Leather Boots]], granting {{icon/luck}}, {{icon/empower}}, and {{icon/block}} once the player is somewhat injured, although it gives much more {{icon/block}} and has the added effect of reducing ranged and effect damage taken for a time after it triggers.

Once triggered, if the damage the player would take comes from a source that is both {{icon/ranged}} AND {{icon/effect}}, the damage is reduced twice for 70% (35%+35%) damage reduction.
